#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 797
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 816
#. i18n: tag Comment
#. i18n: file functions/math.xml line 832
#. i18n: tag Comment
